a9200000-0000-4000-8000-8683cdf3bd16
ok 8 - the builder is owned by the CMS definer role, which is neither superuser nor BYPASSRLS, so every read it makes is subject to row-level security [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 9 - every table the builder reads has forced row-level security with a policy on the CMS RPC context [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 10 - control: with the CMS RPC context the builder returns the nine-group manifest of the revision [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 11 - without the CMS RPC context the revision is invisible under RLS: the builder answers NOT_FOUND [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 12 - a context other than true is no context: NOT_FOUND [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 13 - the context match is exact (TRUE is not true): NOT_FOUND [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 14 - the context is evaluated per statement: restored, the same call returns the manifest again [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 15 - outside the context the currency predicates see no canonical rows: the frozen manifest is stale and its identities are not current [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 16 - control: inside the context the same frozen manifest is current and its identities are current [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 17 - there is exactly one builder and its only input is the revision id: no manifest, hash or version-set value can be passed in [P2-S11-AC-087]
ok 18 - no other function named like a manifest builder returns a manifest [P2-S11-AC-087]
